<% content_for :title, "Supplements · Food Plan Tracker" %>

<header class="safe-top px-5 pb-4">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Supplements</h1>
  <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Your daily stack by time of day.</p>
</header>

<div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start lg:gap-6 lg:px-4">
<% SupplementSchedule::TIME_SLOT_LABELS.each do |slot_key, meta| %>
  <section class="px-4 mb-4 lg:my-0 lg:px-0">
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100 shadow-sm divide-y divide-slate-100 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2.5 bg-slate-50/70">
        <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 font-semibold"><%= meta[:label] %></h2>
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400"><%= meta[:time] %></span>
      </div>
      <% (@grouped[slot_key] || []).each do |schedule| %>
        <% supplement = schedule.supplement %>
        <% taken = @taken_ids.include?(supplement.id) %>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 px-4 py-3 <%= "bg-purple-50/40" if supplement.critical %>">
          <% if taken %>
            <%= button_to supplement_completion_path(@daily_log.supplement_completions.find_by(supplement_id: supplement.id)),
                  method: :delete,
                  class: "mt-0.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold" do %>
              ✓
            <% end %>
          <% else %>
            <%= button_to supplement_completions_path(supplement_id: supplement.id),
                  method: :post,
                  class: "mt-0.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full ring-2 ring-slate-300 hover:ring-slate-400" do %>
              <span class="sr-only">Mark taken</span>
            <% end %>
          <% end %>
          <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <p class="font-medium text-slate-900 truncate <%= "text-purple-800" if supplement.critical %>">
                <% if supplement.critical %>⭐<% end %>
                <%= supplement.name %>
              </p>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-500"><%= supplement.dose %></span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5"><%= supplement.notes %></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </section>
<% end %>

<% if @critical_warnings.any? { |s| s.contraindications.present? } %>
  <section class="px-4 mt-6 lg:my-0 lg:px-0 lg:col-span-2">
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 p-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-rose-900 mb-2">⚠️ Do not combine with Fibrotina</p>
      <ul class="text-sm text-rose-800 space-y-1">
        <% @critical_warnings.each do |sup| %>
          <% if sup.contraindications.present? %>
            <% sup.contraindications.split("·").each do |line| %>
              <li>— <%= line.strip %></li>
            <% end %>
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
<% end %>

<section class="px-4 mt-6 mb-4 lg:my-0 lg:px-0 lg:col-span-2">
  <details class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100 shadow-sm group [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden [&_summary]:list-none">
    <summary class="cursor-pointer px-4 py-3 flex items-center justify-between hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700/40 rounded-2xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-900/50 flex items-center justify-center text-lg">🧠</div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Why this stack? <span class="text-xs text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 ml-1 font-normal">(tap to read)</span></p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Evidence-based rationale</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition text-lg">▾</span>
    </summary>
    <div class="px-4 pb-4 space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-700">
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">☀️ Morning — with breakfast</p>
        <p class="mt-1 leading-relaxed">Vitamin D3 + K2 are fat-soluble and synergistic (K2 directs calcium to bone rather than arteries). Omega-3 (EPA+DHA) lowers hs-CRP per the 2022 Kavyani meta-analysis. Curcumin Meriva is the bioavailable form — same anti-inflammatory effect. Mind Lab Pro stacks Lion's Mane and L-Theanine for focus without jitter.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">🥣 Pre-lunch — psyllium</p>
        <p class="mt-1 leading-relaxed">10g soluble fiber 15 min before lunch blunts the post-meal glucose spike and slightly improves LDL and HDL independent of fenofibrate.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">💊 Dinner — Fibrotina (critical) + stack</p>
        <p class="mt-1 leading-relaxed">Fenofibrate needs dietary fat for absorption — always with a fatty dinner. CoQ10 Ubiquinol offsets the small depletion fenofibrate can cause. Creatine monohydrate is the best-studied strength supplement (5g/day is enough). Second omega-3 dose hits the 2g/day total that the 2025 dose-response meta shows needed for CRP reduction.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">🌙 Before bed — sleep stack</p>
        <p class="mt-1 leading-relaxed">Magnesium glycinate (best-absorbed form) + L-Theanine improve deep-sleep quality, which in turn lowers next-day CRP and cortisol. Skip L-Theanine if already in Mind Lab Pro.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 italic">Not medical advice. Discuss any changes with your physician — especially the Fibrotina dose.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>
</div>
